tabs: File Write Edit Adaptation [Revision] Collaboration View
## Step
  L Next icon=foreground_arrow-forward.svg name=Next Open Item
  S Previous icon=foreground_arrow-back.svg name=Previous Open Item
  S None Open icon=foreground_list.svg name=Open Items: 0 items of the kinds shown (the Notes pane lists them)
## Show
  S To do icon=- (checked) name=Show To-dos
  S Cut icon=- (checked) name=Show Cuts
  S Note icon=- (checked) name=Show Notes
  S Beats icon=- (checked) name=Show Beats
  S Revision icon=- (checked) name=Show Revision Notes
  S Checks icon=- (checked) name=Show Findings
## Item
  L Keep icon=foreground_document-save.svg (disabled) name=Keep as Revision Note
  S Dismiss icon=foreground_visibility-off.svg (disabled) name=Dismiss Item
  S Done icon=foreground_check.svg (disabled) name=Mark To-do Done
  S Restore icon=foreground_content-undo.svg (disabled) name=Restore Cut
  S Edit icon=foreground_document-create.svg (disabled) name=Edit Item
## All at Once
  S Remove Done icon=foreground_delete.svg (disabled) name=Remove Done To-dos…
  S Dismissed in Document icon=foreground_visibility-off.svg name=Keep Dismissed Findings in the Document
